<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge" />
    <title>Welcome to EduZone</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f0f2f5;
        padding: 20px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
      }

      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1c1e53 0%, #2d3561 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 32px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .header h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .header p {
        font-size: 14px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 32px 24px;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #333;
      }

      .content p {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .highlight {
        color: #fcd980;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        background-color: #fcd980;
        color: #1c1e53;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-radius: 8px;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        margin: 16px 0;
        border: 2px solid #fcd980;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .button:hover {
        background-color: #f7c843;
        border-color: #f7c843;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(252, 217, 128, 0.3);
      }

      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background-color: #eaeaea;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }

      .features {
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }

      .features h3 {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: #1c1e53;
      }

      .features ul {
        list-style: none;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #666;
      }

      .features li {
        padding: 8px 0;
        padding-left: 24px;
        position: relative;
      }

      .features li:before {
        content: "✓";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: #fcd980;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .footer {
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 24px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #999;
        border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea;
      }

      .footer a {
        color: #1c1e53;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .social-links {
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .social-links a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 0 8px;
        color: #1c1e53;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .content,
        .header,
        .footer {
          padding: 20px;
        }

        .header h1 {
          font-size: 22px;
        }

        .button {
          width: 100%;
          text-align: center;
          display: block;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to EduZone 🎉</h1>
        <p>Hi <%= name %>, let's start your learning journey!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>
          Thank you for joining <span class="highlight">EduZone</span> — your
          platform for smart learning!
        </p>

        <p>
          To get started, please verify your email address by clicking the
          button below:
        </p>

        <center>
          <a href="<%= verificationLink %>" class="button">Verify Email</a>
        </center>

        <div class="features">
          <h3>What you can do with EduZone:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Access personalized learning paths</li>
            <li>Track your progress in real-time</li>
            <li>Join interactive study groups</li>
            <li>Get expert guidance and resources</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #999">
          If you didn't request this account, please ignore this email or
          <a href="#" style="color: #1c1e53; text-decoration: none"
            >contact support</a
          >.
        </p>

        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #999">
          For security, this link expires in 24 hours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          Have questions?
          <a href="mailto:support@eduzone.com">Contact our support team</a>
        </p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="#">Twitter</a> | <a href="#">Facebook</a> |
          <a href="#">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px">
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> EduZone. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
